    "author": "Doomcraft",
    "description": "A causeway over a lava basin, a crypt with the red keycard, and one gate. Behind the gate is a hall with a throne in it, and the switch that ends this is on the wall behind the throne. Nothing between you and it is small.",
    "parTimeSec": 300,
