  "//geometry": [
    "Three rooms and one gate. The level is deliberately short and vertical: the",
    "whole map is a walk toward a thing that is bigger than you.",
    "",
    "  R0  landing        x 42..54  z 84..92  y8..14   (spawn)",
    "  LB  lava basin     x 30..66  z 58..83  y8..22   floor is lava except the causeway",
    "  CW  causeway       x 45..51  z 59..82           a metal path, seven blocks wide",
    "  A   antechamber    x 24..72  z 40..57  y8..22   pillars, bone floor, the first barons",
    "  CR  crypt          x  4..22  z 40..57  y8..16   the RED keycard on a bone plinth",
    "  GP  crypt throat   x 23      z 46..50  y8..12",
    "  D1  RED GATE       x 46..50  z 39      y8..13",
    "  T   throne hall    x 10..86  z  8..38  y8..26",
    "  TH  throne dais    x 40..56  z 12..22  rises to y12, stair on the south face",
    "  EX  exit           x 44..52  z  8..11            behind the throne",
    "  SW  exit switch    x 48      y10  z 7            on the wall behind the throne",
    "  S1  secret vault   x 88..92  z 20..26            behind a fake wall at x 87",
    "  S2  secret armoury x 74..80  z 44..52            behind a fake wall at x 73",
    "",
    "The red gate is the only way north, so the crypt is not optional, and the",
    "exit switch is on the far wall of the throne hall: you cannot touch it",
    "without crossing the whole floor the barons are standing on."
  ],

